 ions skills? Join our conversation group with Literacy Chicago and improve
  your ability to communicate. This group focuses on having lively discussi
 ons about current events\, life in Chicago\, and many other topics. Learn 
 to be more confident in expressing yourself in English\, gain conversation
 al vocabulary\, meet new people\, and have fun! You should register online
  at the Literacy Ch\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/ev
 ents/6a340880c7d3cd58006138b3
