DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Included with admissi
 on\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: General\\n\\nYou probably know how importa
 nt pollinators are\, but what exactly is pollination? Join Collections Man
 ager of Seed Plants Kimberly Hanson and Collections Assistant Chrissy Chri
 stian as we discuss why pollinators are important\, the importance of flow
 ers to us and their ecosystems\, and be inspired to look closer at the pla
 nts around you. We'll also explore interesting fruits and seeds while disc
 ussing plant adaptations to different modes of pollinators.\\n\\nMore info
 : https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/meet-a-scientist/meet-a-scientist
